  "body": "Big families need big homes-and this brand-new Ara Hills residence delivers exactly that.\r\n\r\nWith six bedrooms, three living areas and a thoughtful layout designed for modern family living, there's room for everyone to spread out while still coming together in the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nThe designer kitchen, complete with a spacious scullery, flows effortlessly into the open-plan living and dining, while seamless indoor-outdoor flow makes entertaining easy all year round.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n\r\n* Six generous bedrooms\r\n* Three bathrooms, including ensuites\r\n* Three separate living areas\r\n* Designer kitchen with scullery\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Double internal access garage\r\n* Separate laundry\r\n* Brand-new with quality finishes throughout\r\n\r\nSet in the thriving Ara Hills community, you're just minutes from Orewa Beach, local cafés, schools, shopping, motorway access   \r\nand scenic walking trails-offering the perfect blend of coastal lifestyle and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, accommodating extended family or simply looking for more space, this is a home designed to grow with you.\r\n\r\nCan't make the open home? No problem. An agent lives just minutes away, meaning private viewings can often be arranged with as little as 10 minutes' notice.\r\n\r\n9 Halcyon Bay Lane, Ara Hill\r\nhttps://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35122",
